      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرْدِنٌ</span></b>  <i>Dark;</i> (S, M, K;) applied to night.
(M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, applied to sweat, <i>Stinking:</i> (K:)
or, thus applied, <i>that wets all the skin:</i> (M:)
[or] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْدُونٌ</span></b>  has the latter meaning, thus applied. (T.)

